              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nimba vyari bizwi ko iyo mpfizi ikunda kugwana, hanyuma nyeneyo ntaheze ngo yame ayiziritse, nyeneyo azorihe iyo yapfuye, hanyuma atware uwo muvyimba.",
